/*
    Shattered Worlds perception object.

    Dredd. Modified from the original stuff in the US player.c

    980121 Dredd Changed the who function
    980228 Greebo bug fixed the who function
    981211 Jenna   Hilited exits in brief mode
    991116 Jenna   Added new form of diag/hp/sp command (specific damage) 	
